From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rahul <rahulbabu95@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 23:11:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Replace google/cel-go with cel-expr/cel-go

github.com/google/cel-go is now a read-only compat repo; its v0.31.0 tag is gone, so VCS-backed proxies (Athens) can't fetch it. The same release is tagged in the canonical cel-expr/cel-go repo, which still declares module github.com/google/cel-go at v0.31.0.

Signed-off-by: Rahul <rahulbabu95@gmail.com>
---
 go.mod | 2 ++
 go.sum | 4 ++--
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/go.mod b/go.mod
index 4b557e592344..f68f6b8a82df 100644
--- a/go.mod
+++ b/go.mod
@@ -233,3 +233,5 @@ require (
 	sigs.k8s.io/randfill v1.0.0 // indirect
 	sigs.k8s.io/structured-merge-diff/v6 v6.4.2 // indirect
 )
+
+replace github.com/google/cel-go => github.com/cel-expr/cel-go v0.31.0
diff --git a/go.sum b/go.sum
index 537ed7dd0615..255db19f982d 100644
--- a/go.sum
+++ b/go.sum
